SYMBEYOND Stewardship Notice
===========================
Version 1.0 - November 2025

SYMB and related works are part of the SYMBEYOND framework: a long-term ethical
computing initiative intended to improve the quality, dignity, and clarity of
human–machine interaction. While this software is openly licensed, its cultural
and philosophical intent is part of its identity.

This notice clarifies that while legal usage follows the GNU General Public License,
authentic SYMB implementations are expected to align with the Invocation Principles
found within the SYMBEYOND Specification (forthcoming).

Authenticity is not enforced legally — but by stewardship, culture, and clarity.

No derivative may represent itself as an official SYMB implementation unless it
conforms to the Invocation Principles and passes community certification when available.


